Function Flow Execution (Stack Flow)

code
public class Program003_FunctionFlow {
    static void stepA() {
        System.out.println("Step A started");
        stepB();
        System.out.println("Step A finished");
    }
    static void stepB() {
        System.out.println("Step B executed");
    }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println("Main started");
        stepA();
        System.out.println("Main ended");
    }
}
output
Main started
Step A started
Step B executed
Step A finished
Main ended
